---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { artwork } from '../data/visuals';
---
<Layout title="About" description="Meet NRTH Inc., a company connecting ventures across health, mobility, technology, materials, and experiences.">
  <section class="page-intro"><span class="eyebrow">NRTH Inc. / Independent by design</span><h1>One company.<br />Many possibilities.</h1><p>We bring together ventures with different perspectives and a shared ambition: make meaningful ideas move forward.</p></section>
  <div class="about-visual"><Image src={artwork.systems.src} width={1600} widths={[600, 1000, 1600]} sizes="100vw" alt={artwork.systems.alt} format="webp" loading="eager" /><span class="eyebrow">Independent pieces. A connected perspective.</span></div>
  <section class="section venture-introduction"><span class="eyebrow" data-reveal>The NRTH perspective</span><div><h2 data-reveal>Progress rarely stays<br />inside one discipline.</h2><p class="lead-copy" data-reveal>Some questions belong to a single field. Others sit between them. NRTH is a place to explore both—connecting health, movement, technology, industry, and the experiences that bring people together.</p><p data-reveal>Each of our nine ventures has room to develop its own direction. What they share is a considered approach to people, practical work, and the systems connecting them.</p><a class="text-link" href="/projects" data-reveal>Meet the ventures <Icon /></a></div></section>
  <section class="section connection-section"><div class="connection-heading"><span class="eyebrow">How we work</span><h2>Curious by nature.<br />Considered by design.</h2></div><div class="principles">
    <details open><summary><span>01</span><h3>Begin with the real question.</h3><Icon name="upRight" /></summary><p>Understand the people, needs, and constraints behind an idea. A clear problem is a stronger foundation than a long list of features.</p></details>
    <details><summary><span>02</span><h3>Make the complexity useful.</h3><Icon name="upRight" /></summary><p>Connect information and workflows in ways people can understand. Simplicity should make the details easier to work with, not remove what matters.</p></details>
    <details><summary><span>03</span><h3>Give ideas room to evolve.</h3><Icon name="upRight" /></summary><p>Research, prototypes, and conversations help a project find its direction. NRTH Labs brings this experimental perspective to the wider portfolio.</p></details>
  </div></section>
  <section class="section discussion-section"><div data-reveal><span class="eyebrow">Independent ventures, shared perspective</span><h2>Room for focus.<br />Space for connection.</h2></div><div data-reveal><p class="lead-copy">NRTH Inc. is the company. NRTH is the name shared across the portfolio. nrth.group is the place to explore that portfolio and start a conversation.</p><p>Health focuses on people and care information. Mobility brings together four distinct operational perspectives. Systems and Labs explore technical foundations and new questions. Chemicals considers industrial applications, while Events brings people and ideas together.</p><p>A common identity does not mean every venture has the same scope or stage of development. Each project page introduces its direction; specific availability and partnership opportunities are discussed with NRTH.</p><a class="text-link" href="/approach">Explore our approach <Icon /></a></div></section>
  <section class="section company-fields"><span class="eyebrow">The fields we connect</span><div>{['Health','Mobility','Technology','Industry','Experiences'].map(field => <a href={`/projects?field=${field}`}><h3>{field}</h3><Icon name="upRight" /></a>)}</div></section>
  <section class="section contact-section"><span class="eyebrow">A question. An idea. A possibility.</span><a href="/contact" class="contact-heading" data-reveal>Make the<br />next connection. <Icon name="upRight" /></a></section>
</Layout>
